    "name": "How to appeal a WhatsApp Business account suspension",
    "title": "How to appeal a WhatsApp Business account suspension",
    "source_locale": "en-us",
    "locale": "en-us",
    "outdated": false,
    "outdated_locales": [],
    "edited_at": "2026-04-17T00:59:55Z",
    "user_segment_id": null,
    "permission_group_id": 146372,
    "content_tag_ids": [],
    "label_names": [],
    "body": "<p>Submit a review in Meta Business Portfolio to appeal a WhatsApp restriction or ban.</p>\n<p>Appeal a restricted or banned WhatsApp Business Account by submitting a review request through Meta. If you believe your account complies with WhatsApp policies, ask Meta to reassess the decision.</p>\n<p>If your WhatsApp channel in Klaviyo shows <em>Restricted</em> or <em>Banned</em>, Meta has taken an enforcement action on your account. Klaviyo cannot override or influence Meta’s decisions.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01KJXDWWVWZS7CR162YBDXD7D0\">Before you begin</h2>\n<p>Gather the information you will include in your appeal and confirm you can access Meta Business Portfolio.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Make sure you can sign in to Meta Business Portfolio.</li>\n<li>Read <a href=\"https://business.whatsapp.com/policy\">WhatsApp Business Messaging</a>.</li>\n<li>Prepare your business details and documentation of opt-in consent.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01KJXDWWVYRGM1G59NHGT08FTH\">Check the reason for your restriction</h2>\n<p>Confirm the official reason for the restriction in Meta Business Portfolio before you submit a review.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Log in to Meta Business Portfolio.</li>\n<li>Navigate to WhatsApp Manager.</li>\n<li>Select your affected WhatsApp Business Account.</li>\n<li>Locate the alert banner at the top of the page indicating a policy issue.</li>\n<li>Click the alert to view details about the violation.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Meta provides the official reason for enforcement actions. Klaviyo cannot override or influence Meta’s decisions.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01KJXDWWW15YC3NGFBH1QSD512\">Request a review in Meta</h2>\n<p>Submit a review in Meta Business Support if you believe your account complies with WhatsApp policies.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to Meta Business Support Home.</li>\n<li>Select the relevant WhatsApp Business Account.</li>\n<li>Choose the listed violation you want to appeal.</li>\n<li>Click Request Review.</li>\n<li>Enter supporting details about your business and how you use WhatsApp.</li>\n<li>Click Submit.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>After submission, your case moves to the <em>In Review</em> tab in Meta Business Portfolio.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01KJXDWWWBXFPZM15SH3C13V6N\">Prevent future violations</h2>\n<p>Follow these best practices to reduce the risk of additional restrictions.</p>\n<h3 id=\"h_01KJXDWWWB68TSMEBYJNC00EM3\">Review WhatsApp policies</h3>\n<p>Read and follow the <a href=\"https://business.whatsapp.com/policy\">WhatsApp Business Messaging Policy</a>. Ensure your products, messaging, and use cases comply.</p>\n<h3 id=\"h_01KJXDWWWBHBTQCAECP4ATXF8E\">Confirm proper opt-in practices</h3>\n<p>Message only users who provided clear, valid opt-in consent. Store documentation showing how and when consent was collected.</p>\n<h3 id=\"h_01KJXDWWWCW1Z6BF5WANEP6XPN\">Monitor account health</h3>\n<p>Subscribe to to receive real-time notifications of policy violations or enforcement actions, or use <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/47290590424347\">WhatsApp Deliverability Hub</a> to monitor. </p>\n<h3 id=\"h_01KJXDWWWCMB235NY2VN168MD0\">Act quickly on warnings</h3>\n<p>If you receive a warning:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Pause questionable campaigns.</li>\n<li>Review recent message activity.</li>\n<li>Adjust your messaging practices immediately.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01KJXDWWWD9BNJZD5ZRPEE2BTM\"></h2>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
